    "excerpt": "DSH ships its own chat agents but has no first-class memory: every new session starts from zero. dsh-tool-memory-amem plugs an A-MEM style agentic memory into DSH — every user message is captured as a structured note, automatically linked to existing memories through an LLM-drive"
